  "description": "VOKPIW crystallizes in the trigonal crystal system with space group P -3 c 1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C81 H120 Gd3 N6 Ni3 O22 1+,Cl1 O4 1-,5.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 4 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 4 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.425-3.864 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.28-108.42°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ni3Gd3(μ3-O)(μ3-OH)3(L)3(μ-OOCCMe3)3](ClO4)·15CH3CN·18CH2Cl2·3CH3OH·7.5H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 3 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
